    Fixed interface strings only.

    Nothing here is an observation about a person's behavior. Every sentence about
    what someone did comes from a corpus file through the engine layers in order,
    per MASTER_BUILD_PROMPT section 11. The lines below are labels, actions and
    direct readouts of a queried number, which the design document specifies
    verbatim and which carry no interpretation.
-->
